-+> **Heads up:** YouTube changes how it delivers ads every few weeks, so ad blocking can break without warning. When it does, please [open an issue](https://github.com/Someshog/NeverMore/issues/new/choose) with logcat output. Fixes usually only need small changes to the pruning script.
- 
--- **Ads still appear.** YouTube changes how it delivers ads often. Check `AD_KEYS` in `assets/yt_adblock.js`, and open an issue with `adb logcat -s NeverMore BraveEngine` output captured while an ad plays.
--- **"DOCUMENT_START_SCRIPT unsupported" in logcat.** Update the TV's Android System WebView.
--- **"Native library NOT available" in logcat.** The library for your device's CPU is missing. Build it for that ABI.
